# Electron & IPC

- Renderer: `contextIsolation: true`, `nodeIntegration: false`, no direct `fs`/`child_process`.
- Expose APIs only through `preload.ts` → `contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld('pigAgents', …)`.
- Channel naming: `pig:<domain>:<action>` (e.g. `pig:workspace:pickFolder`).
- Handler errors: structured `{ code, message }`; never leak stack traces to renderer in production.
- Agent streaming: `mainWindow.webContents.send('pig:agent:event', event)` — not EventSource/SSE.
- Secrets and `.env` loading only in main process (`app/electron/src/env.ts`).
